@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+Commands:
+kprove audit-spec-vacuity.k --definition verification-kompiled-audit --spec-module AUDIT-SPEC-VACUITY --dry-run
+
+kprove audit-spec-vacuity.k --definition verification-kompiled-audit --spec-module AUDIT-SPEC-VACUITY
+
