  ✓ Stage 6: create and run a fresh false non-vacuity mutation
  → Stage 7: account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md
diff --git a//tmp/audit-work/candidate/audit-spec-body-sensitivity.k b//tmp/audit-work/candidate/audit-spec-body-sensitivity.k
new file mode 100644
